  <content>
  <section><title><emphasis>Getting Ready for Unit 1</emphasis></title>
<para dir="ltr">To be ready for this unit, you need to be able to:</para>
<list>
  <item>Solve linear equations using a general strategy.</item>
  <item>Classify equations.</item>
  <item>Identify points on a graph.</item>
</list>
<para dir="ltr">Next, you will answer some questions that will help you see how ready you are for this unit. If you need help, some mini-lessons will help you brush up on anything you need to work on. </para></section>
</content>
</document>
